<title>HONG KONG: HK's Benefun says IPO 105 times oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>HK's Benefun says IPO 105 times oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casual wear retailer Benefun International Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its initial public offering of 100 million new shares at HK$1.15 each was 105 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement dealing in the shares would begin next Tuesday.</p>
<p>Benefun is principally engaged in retailing and manufacture of casual wear in China, Hong Kong and Taiwan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
